# "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, draw a card." The Frog (1/2) attacks Bot2's Liliana of
# the Veil on turn 3 and draws; attacks Bot2 on turn 5, unblocked, and draws; and on turn 7 is blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter,
# dealing its damage to that creature, and draws nothing. Bot1 plays an Island each turn so the hand sizes stay clear of the
# discard to seven.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Psychic Frog
Island x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Liliana of the Veil
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

